<h2>Reminder: View Your Schedule</h2>
<p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
<p>A schedule was published for your team but you haven't viewed it yet. Please review your upcoming shifts.</p>
<div class="detail">
  <strong>Schedule:</strong> {{scheduleName}}<br>
  <strong>Period:</strong> {{startDate}} – {{endDate}}
</div>
{{#if link}}
<p><a href="{{link}}" class="btn">View My Schedule</a></p>
{{/if}}
<p>Viewing the schedule confirms you're aware of your assigned shifts.</p>
